  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tu4f](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tu4f) Magnitude 6.2 earthquake at 142.833 depth occurred on Oct 29 2026 36km NW of Walaha. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -15.1891 longitude 167.4523. It impacted 35784 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
